# GitNexus-generated (wholly inside <!-- gitnexus:start/end -->; rebuilt by
# `npx gitnexus analyze`, whose stat line churns on every commit)
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# A graph repo living inside this checkout: `<project>-tree`. Every project
# that clones the engine in at <project>/agi/ nests its tree one level deeper
# as its OWN repo (<project>/agi/<project>-tree), so a clone of this engine
# will contain fantasia-tree, agi-tree, whatever-tree. None of them are ever
# committed here — that is the vendoring failure H0/H0b already cost us twice.
#
# Root-anchored and generic on purpose:
#   - `agi-tree` alone would ignore only this one pair and leave every other
#     project's tree untracked-but-committable inside its engine clone.
#   - no trailing slash: in the self-referential agi <-> agi-tree case the
#     entry is a SYMLINK, and `*-tree/` does not match a symlink.
/*-tree
